## 6. Proposed Action Plan for Hotfix-005

1. In `BrowserProfileManager`, remove directory creation for `cookies_dir` (`cookies_dir = profile_dir / "cookies"`). Let Chromium manage the `Cookies` SQLite file in `profile_dir`.
2. Clean up any existing `cookies` directory in existing profile folders (`shutil.rmtree` if `cookies` is a directory).
3. Verify that `Cookies` (SQLite file, size > 0 bytes) is written to disk when navigating/logging in.
4. Add automated unit test verifying `Cookies` is a file (not a directory) and has size > 0 bytes after navigation.

